    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the economic development law, in relation to the authorization\nof the department of economic development to give a preference to any tourist\npromotion agency that is promoting the sport of stickball",
    "basePrintNo": "S8895",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8895-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
      {
       "alternate": false,
       "chamber": "SENATE",
